<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Jetřichovické vyhlídky circuit — Jetřichovické vyhlídky circuit</name><desc>From the Jetřichovice bus stop, pass St John of Nepomuk church and the Chapel of the Last Judgement, then climb via Pohovka to Rudolfův kámen. Continue to Vilemínina stěna, Balzerovo ležení and Mariina skála before returning to the village. The viewpoint spurs include steep steps, ladders and exposed rock; allow time for the climbs and views.

